# ai-news-agent digest schedule (read by supercronic).
#
# Default: every weekday at 10:00 Asia/Bangkok (= 03:00 UTC since TZ=Asia/Bangkok).
# Bangkok is UTC+7 year-round (no DST), so 10:00 ICT = 03:00 UTC.
# Override via DIGEST_CRON env var; the entrypoint substitutes it on startup.
#
# Cron format: minute hour day-of-month month day-of-week command
__CRON_SCHEDULE__ cd /app && node dist/__SCRIPT_NAME__.js >> /app/logs/__LOG_NAME__.log 2>&1
